          {
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "level": 0,
            "text": "Whispering Frost : 'The Moonlit Meringues exhale a chilling breath infused with frostmint. Each creature in a 15-foot cone must succeed on a DC 13 Constitution saving throw or take 10 (3d6) cold damage and have their speed reduced by 10 feet until the start of the Meringue's next turn.",
