      {
        "node_type": "heading",
        "level": 2,
        "text": "LEGENDARY ACTIONS",
        "source_line_start": 48,
        "source_line_end": 49,
        "children": [
          {
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "level": 0,
            "text": "The Moonlit Meringues can take 1 legendary action, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The Moonlit Meringues regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.",
            "source_line_start": 51,
            "source_line_end": 52
          },
          {
            "node_type": "paragraph",
            "level": 0,
            "text": "Gravity Tumble : ‘The Moonlit Meringues collapse into a pile and then reform, instantly moving up to 20 feet without provoking opportunity attacks. All creatures within 5 feet of the new location must succeed on a DC 13 Dexterity saving throw or take 5 (1d10) bludgeoning damage from the impact of the reverberating confection.’",
            "source_line_start": 54,
